accTitle: Preserve input through both alert paths
accDescr: Local catchers add an error to an input envelope, while failures outside those catchers use external execution monitoring and durable input references. Both paths feed the notification process.
I["Input envelope<br/>args + inputRef"]:::inputData --> T["Task / Map / Parallel"]
T -->|"Caught error after retries"| C["ResultPath $.error<br/>args + inputRef + error"]:::output
T -->|"Uncaught or execution timeout"| E["FAILED / TIMED_OUT event"]:::warning
C --> N["SNS email notification"]:::output
E --> M["External alert handler"]
R[("Durable diagnostic input")]:::storage --> M
P["Execution reconciliation"]:::decision --> M
M --> N
